          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Stop-work trigger",
          "guidance": "Stop cleaning and notify the facility contact if isolation cannot be verified, electrical parts become wet, runoff cannot be contained, an unsafe roof or weather condition develops, suspected hazardous material is encountered, or the requested method conflicts with equipment or chemical instructions. Obtain professional review when the condition is outside the crew's authorization or competence."
